WEBVTT

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:10.900
Last time on Dragon Ball Z, the evil androids 19 and 20 appeared on an island nine miles southwest of South City, just like Trunks had predicted.

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:25.470
When a powerful glow from Goku did nothing more than knock the androids' hat off, it was clear that the Saiyan was up against an enemy of immeasurable strength.

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:29.970
In addition, Android 20 revealed that their creator had already studied Goku's strength and power.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.230
technique and has accordingly equipped them with far superior abilities you might think that you

00:01:35.230 --> 00:01:40.920
know all there is to know about me but really you're not even close but dr jaro's research

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:46.260
didn't stretch into the far reaches of space so there was one ability of goku's that he couldn't

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:59.520
account for his ability to transform into a super saiyan yes it

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.260
It is quite an impressive ability, but it is nothing we cannot handle.

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:06.840
Nineteen will demonstrate this for you now.

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:13.960
Ha! All right, if you insist, but I'd cancel your next tune-up if I were you.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:21.380
You're all mine!

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:34.820
Good job, Goku.

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:13.600
Don't worry, Chiaotzu. They'll be okay.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:16.280
Hope you're right, Master Roshi.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:20.300
Knock, knock. Hello in there. It's me, Krillin.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:23.500
Oh, uh, he's not here right now.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:26.840
He's off trying to save the world from, uh, two deadly androids.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:28.000
You know how it is, huh?

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:29.040
Ooh.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:37.110
Gosh, you mean my Krillin's in danger?

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:39.180
I should never have left him.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:40.700
He was so kind to me.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:46.280
I didn't even know what love was till I met him.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:49.950
Oh, Krillin, please take me back.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.640
My poor, beautiful Krillin!

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.120
He's lost, but...

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.200
No, I can't give up.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:08.740
Where are you hiding, Krillin?

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:10.480
Please?

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:12.280
Come on, don't do this to me.

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:13.640
I really need you.

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:15.310
Are you here?

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:15.910
Hello?

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:17.150
Krillin?

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:18.430
Aaron!

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:20.130
Krillin's not lost!

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:24.690
He's gone to fight the evil androids created by the ex-leader of the Red Ribbon Army!

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:26.590
What? Red Ribbon?

00:05:26.730 --> 00:05:28.200
Oh my goodness!

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:29.720
Krillin!

00:05:30.190 --> 00:05:33.970
You knew I was coming, so you went out and got a red ribbon for me!

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:44.620
Dream warned us. He got back into his time machine and took off.

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:49.220
And now the androids are here. Just like he said they'd be three years later.

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:52.220
Which means he was telling the truth!

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:55.500
What a fight it'll be! I wish I was there!

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:59.980
We usually fight right alongside those guys! Darn shame we feel-

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:08.040
left off! What? My? Krillin? No! All right, all right! He'll be back soon, I promise! It won't be long now!

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:13.940
But allow me to keep you company until he returns! Only if you tell me the story about the red ribbons again!

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:22.760
Well, it's not exactly what I had in mind, but... Please! Oh, okay. It all began when Goku was just a boy!

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:29.980
He was on a mission to collect all seven Dragon Balls. It was a training mission, designed...

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.630
to... to sharpen his skills.

00:06:33.340 --> 00:06:35.950
Hey, that's one up ahead!

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:39.550
The Wicked Red Ribbon Army was also after the Dragon Balls,

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:42.320
and due to Dr. Giro's scientific breakthroughs,

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:45.840
this ruthless organization had radically advanced robotics

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:46.760
at their disposal.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:04.420
But luckily, Goku was not your average boy, or he would have perished for sure.

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:09.110
I just knocked this block off and he's still standing.

00:07:09.370 --> 00:07:10.310
I don't know how!

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.120
General Tau was Goku's most dangerous adversary.

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.740
He was a skilled master of the martial arts,

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:20.440
but like so many others, his power only made him thirsty for more.

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:26.850
He was the mastermind behind all of the Red Ribbon Army's military operations,

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:29.910
and his objective was nothing less than to rule the world.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.590
And he would have, if it weren't for Goku.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:52.690
General Tau never anticipated that such a powerful attack

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:54.510
could come from such a small boy.

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:56.150
He was speechless.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.320
Pretty good. I'm impressed.

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:06.440
Now it's my turn!

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:15.860
You're just a big bully. I'm not afraid of you anymore, Tao.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:20.580
Then Goku delivered a damaging blow, winding the general.

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:22.970
Oh, it wasn't pretty after that.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:27.310
Goku brought the hammer down and treated the general's head as if it were a punching bag.

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:35.610
Goku knocked the general silly, even had him cry for mercy.

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:38.600
I quit. Change, please.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:41.240
But it was just a sinful trick by a cagey pro.

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:42.500
Sorry, sucker.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:49.590
The general leaped straight up to avoid the blast, but Goku knocked that thing sky high.

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:54.770
And that was the end of one of the most feared martial arts experts in the world.

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:59.930
Now, if General Tao was considered to be the heart of the Red Ribbon Army, then it was Dr.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:11.360
Jaro who's the brains behind it. So, Goku still had his work cut out for him, and true to form for someone as powerful and crazy as Goku was, he attacked the entire Red Ribbon Army, head on!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:22.810
Kid, say cheese!

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:28.040
K. Cheese!

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:32.700
Little by little, Goku was doing the impossible!

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:38.480
He was defeating the Red Ribbon Army single-handedly!

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:44.170
IDIOTS! I WANT HIM STOP! HE'S JUST A LITTLE KID!

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:49.060
It was unimaginable that such a small boy could have such tremendous power!

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:59.980
Before long, there was only one man standing-

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:06.430
between Goku and Dr. Jaro himself and aided by one of Dr. Jaro's machines he

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:13.170
was able to gain the upper hand on Goku. He rattled the poor boy senseless for

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:22.010
starters and then he gave him the laser treatment. Things weren't looking too

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:29.490
good for young Goku. Hey you got a little surprise for you kid.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:35.120
So, Goku did what he always does when he's all out of options.

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:37.420
That's it. Hold it right there. Perfect.

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:40.220
He used his head!

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:42.220
They used head as hard!

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:42.990
Yeah!

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:46.580
Uh-oh.

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:49.130
And that was that!

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.970
The entire Red Ribbon Army was no more!

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:53.520
Boy Nibba!

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:56.540
They had been destroyed by a mere boy!

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:59.940
A very special boy, mind you, but a boy all the same!

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:11.240
Well, this made quite an impression on the mastermind behind the Red Ribbon Army, Dr. Jaro, who Goku let slip away.

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:16.340
Jaro was no longer preoccupied with creating an entire army anymore.

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:20.740
What was the point if one boy could destroy the whole thing?

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:28.060
Instead, he became obsessed with using his genius to design a robotic being like Goku.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:36.540
single entity that had the power of an entire army but he realized that his

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:41.930
creation had to be more powerful than Goku or Goku would just defeat it again

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:47.430
but this turned out to be the final chapter of Dr. Jaro's dark but

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:53.330
brilliant career you can't destroy me I created you his new creations were so

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:56.790
evil that they took the doctor's life the second he brought them into the

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:59.930
world and that's the whole story Maron

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:02.020
Right now, Krillin is with Goku and Gohan

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:03.840
and they're trying to stop the roofless monsters.

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:06.530
Quite a tale, huh?

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:08.750
Do you understand a little better now?

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:13.740
Uh, who's gonna protect me from the monsters?

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:20.080
Whoa, man, I can sense the energy big time.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.190
That's my dad, isn't it?

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:24.410
Yeah, but I can't sense the androids.

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:27.690
You must have been right about not being able to sense their power levels.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:50.170
Man, Goku's all over that thing. He's dominating. There's no way that android can beat him.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:53.650
He's hardly laid a finger on him yet. Goku's got it in the bag.

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:54.580
Maybe.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:36.350
Goku's powers greatly exceed anything I had expected.

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:40.240
If the opportunity does not soon arise for Nineteen to steal some energy,

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:43.500
he will drain Nineteen's power supply and begin to malfunction.

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:59.590
Hey, not to worry.

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:01.950
Your dad's got everything under control.

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:04.720
That android never had a chance.

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:12.180
Has he been going like this the whole fight?

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:15.160
Yeah, it's hardly laid a scratch on Goku.

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.880
Keep it up, Goku. That's it.

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:21.800
Come on, Goku.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:29.380
Boy, Goku sure has the upper hand on that guy.

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:33.960
You're not kidding. Just look at him go. He's changing history up there.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.580
It looks like everything will be okay after all.

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:40.330
Yeah, I'm not even worried anymore. Are you Gohan?

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:41.420
Yeah!

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:44.420
You've got good instincts, Gohan.

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:46.010
Huh? I do?

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:52.610
Goku's just not his usual capable self. His blows aren't even hurting the android.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.940
He's gonna need our help, you guys!

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:59.740
Hey, hold on there. He's just fine. You're being paranoid.

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:02.460
I mean, look at him. What could go wrong?

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:06.310
I tell you, something's not right.

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:10.430
Goku's maxed out for some reason. He's not gonna last if this keeps up.

00:15:10.850 --> 00:15:13.230
Yeah, right! Well, I can see it too!

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:16.890
Hey guys, remember when Yamcha said he felt weak after the android touched him?

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:18.410
Like it sucked away all his energy?

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:20.040
What?

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:23.750
Yeah, I felt energy leaving me.

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.820
Like I was being drained or something.

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.380
It felt really weird.

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.600
Goku would know if it were happening to him.

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:37.740
Awesome! Way to go, Goku!

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.600
Incredible! What a kick! Did you see that?

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:40.920
Man, that was great!

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:59.410
If Goku hit me like that, I'd be unable to move for a week!

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:02.190
Yeah, what are those things made of anyway?

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:51.840
Oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:03.170
Boy, that's not good.

00:17:03.510 --> 00:17:06.940
Oh, no! He absorbed it! I was right!

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:10.120
Goku, don't fire any more of your energy waves!

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:14.780
They absorb energy through their hands and it'll only make them stronger! Understand?

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:17.520
You're joking.

00:17:21.860 --> 00:17:23.460
Great. Now what?

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.650
Oh, man. That's too much!

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:41.120
Oh, no! Look, guys! It's Goku! He's tired! Man, how did that thing steal so much of his energy?

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:45.420
I don't think it did. Something else is draining all his strength.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:55.590
Excellent. Now 19 is fully charged again, and it looks like Goku's new technique is wearing him out.

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:59.390
Yes! Yes! The mighty Goku is finished!

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:04.130
No!

00:18:04.740 --> 00:18:05.240
Yeah!

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:06.790
Yeah!

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:07.550
Yeah!

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.880
Goku! No!

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:38.720
Dad, what's wrong?

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:50.060
Star, what's wrong? Am I so weak? Just can't give up!

00:18:53.090 --> 00:18:55.700
I can't believe it! Goku's backing off!

00:18:56.020 --> 00:18:57.660
Yeah, you really must be hurt bad!

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:58.400
But how?

00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:20.320
Yeah, you're right, but it's happening much later than the boy from the future said it would.

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:25.050
Goku thought he'd made a mistake, but somehow his visit has already altered history.

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:41.370
As the androids circle like vultures, the deadly virus attacks Goku from within.

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:47.050
Trunks' prediction is finally coming true, but in a rather sudden and inopportune time.

00:19:48.110 --> 00:19:53.350
What will Goku do now, and how long does he have before the deadly virus runs its course?

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:58.780
Stay tuned for scenes from the next episode of Dragon Ball Z.

00:20:02.364 --> 00:20:04.784
on the next episode of Dragon Ball Z.

00:20:05.244 --> 00:20:07.404
That isn't heartburn that has Goku doubled over

00:20:07.404 --> 00:20:10.184
and leave it to the androids to kick a guy when he's down

00:20:10.184 --> 00:20:12.064
and then steal his energy to boot.

00:20:12.324 --> 00:20:13.184
But just wait!

00:20:13.376 --> 00:20:14.076
Vegito!

00:20:14.076 --> 00:20:14.776
He's whack!

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:19.900
And while Yajir will be goofs around with baby trucks and Bulma shows off her new talents as a mommy.

00:20:20.316 --> 00:20:25.676
Vegeta wants to show off a few new talents of his own next time on Dragon Ball Z.
